openmediavault-example (8.0.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Template skeleton release: full standard plugin structure for
    OpenMediaVault 8.x.
    - Datamodel (conf.service.example) + confdb create script +
      engined RPC service (get/set/start/stop/restart/getLog) +
      engine module (services panel status).
    - Salt state with two integration modes switchable from the
      settings page: systemd service (renders example.conf and
      example.service, manages the unit) and Docker Compose stack
      (renders .env and docker-compose.yml into the compose
      directory, manages the stack).
    - Declarative Workbench pages (navigation page + settings form
      page with status fields, mode select and taskDialog buttons)
      and Simplified/Traditional Chinese translations.
    - GitHub Actions CI: lint + dpkg-buildpackage + Release.

 -- ${GITHUB_USER}  Sat, 04 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0800
